{"publicId":"5bffc10a-6b5c-4a3f-9749-617ae3aff05d","title":"Betelgeuse星盘中发现水冰与二氧化碳冰的混合结晶结构","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T17:30:02.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-16T17:30:02.000Z","digest":"天文学家团队通过詹姆斯·韦伯太空望远镜（JWST）的红外光谱数据，首次在Betelgeuse星盘中检测到水冰与二氧化碳冰的混合物。研究显示，其中水冰的非结晶比例超过93%（团队计算得出结晶水冰占比不足7%），且光谱分析证实约10个水分子中含有一个二氧化碳分子。该成果发表于《Science》论文，推测频繁碰撞可能维持了这种非晶态冰的结构。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-16T17:44:21.769Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Science论文：Betelgeuse星盘首次发现混合态冰，揭示频繁碰撞机制","latestReport":{"id":"ioo3kqszo0n2451o0y5y7gk2n"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fg9W_i9xrFOE","title":"首次发现Beta Pictoris星盘中的非结晶冰","firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T17:30:02.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"ioo3kqszo0n2451o0y5y7gk2n","title":"Science论文：Betelgeuse星盘首次发现混合态冰，揭示频繁碰撞机制","summary":"Science发表研究，首次直接观测到Betelgeuse星盘中水冰与二氧化碳冰的混合物，并推测频繁碰撞可能维持其非晶态结构。该成果为理解年轻恒星系统形成过程提供了新证据。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T17:30:02.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"ioo3kqszo0n2451o0y5y7gk2n","title":"Science论文：Betelgeuse星盘首次发现混合态冰，揭示频繁碰撞机制","summary":"Science发表研究，首次直接观测到Betelgeuse星盘中水冰与二氧化碳冰的混合物，并推测频繁碰撞可能维持其非晶态结构。该成果为理解年轻恒星系统形成过程提供了新证据。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T17:30:02.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-16T18:00:00.000Z","heat":9.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-16T19:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-16T21:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-16T22:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-16T23:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T00:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-1